  "data": {
    "ruleType": "army-rule",
    "summary": "A **LEAGUES OF VOTANN** [Army Faction](vsdata:core-rule/select-army-faction) begins with its units in **Hostile Acquisition** until the first [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts. Use your **Yield Points** (YP) balance at your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) end to determine the mode: **Hostile Acquisition** below 7, **Fortify Takeover** at 7 or above. The result lasts until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts. **Hostile Acquisition** adds +1 to a model’s Hit roll against an enemy near any objective marker, meaning within that marker’s range. The same unit can re-roll its Advance rolls and its Charge rolls. **Fortify Takeover** gives +1 to [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/making-attacks) against enemy units if the attacker’s unit is in range of an objective marker you control. If a Fortify unit lacks **VEHICLE**, incoming attacks above its Toughness in Strength get −1 to their [Wound roll](vsdata:core-rule/wound-rolls). At the end of either player’s [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase), earn 1YP if you hold any markers in your deployment zone. From round 2, earn 1YP apiece for three further checks: hold at least one marker outside your zone, hold at least two outside it, and outnumber your opponent in markers held. On your turn, credit the points before checking which mode applies. Spend YP when a rule calls for payment, with 0 as the balance floor. Other gains and spending can move the balance across 7 between checks, with the mode determined only at your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) end.",
